{"ID":"20240118145008-7i8oss0","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145008-7i8oss0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145008-7i8oss0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145008-lbgclfe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122163235-nbmxk5o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122163235-nbmxk5o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:301,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:301\u0026#125;","title":"343石蚕344雀瓮（蝉蜕）345蜣螂346蝼蛄347马陆348地胆349鼠妇","type":"doc","updated":"20240204151630"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145008-lbgclfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145008-lbgclfe","updated":"20240122162958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"石蚕"}]},{"ID":"20240122162959-5q1zbez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162959-5q1zbez","updated":"20240122163002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，寒，有毒。治五癃，破石淋，堕胎。肉，解结气，利水道，除热。生池泽。一名沙虱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163003-yah9r6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163003-yah9r6x","updated":"20240122163006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"雀瓮（蝉蜕）"}]},{"ID":"20240122163006-rj2sfn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163006-rj2sfn7","updated":"20240122163015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘，平，无毒．治小儿惊痫，寒热，结气，蛊毒，鬼疰。生树枝间。一名躁舍。又名知了。今名蝉蜕。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163020-s8mrf3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163020-s8mrf3f"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】生夏日树间。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163021-zebf4de","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163021-zebf4de"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】昧甘咸性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163023-uq8sbhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163023-uq8sbhm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主冶】为解热镇惊退翳之药，治小儿热惊，皮肤风热瘾疹。目生翳瘴，治小儿哑病及阴肿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163025-pxf88io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163025-pxf88io"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"[1.秦皮3钱、蝉蜕5分、蛇蜕5分三碗煮一碗，可内服可点眼睛，治眼红肿，生翳。]"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163031-3g6iqda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163031-3g6iqda"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】治小儿惊痫，妇人生子不下，烧灰酒服，治久病。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163035-18oj0c7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163035-18oj0c7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】研末一钱，用华水调服，治哑病。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163037-fw0n8cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163037-fw0n8cf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【宗奭】除目昏除翳，以水煎汁服，治小儿疮疹出不快，甚良。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163039-k0c213r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163039-k0c213r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【时珍】治头风眩晕，皮肤风热，痘疹作痒，破伤风，及疔肿毒疮，大人失音，小儿噤风天吊，惊哭夜啼，阴肿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163041-ziyrdkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163041-ziyrdkz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般五分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163043-tjoia3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163043-tjoia3g"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】无。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163044-ao1cuwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163044-ao1cuwj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附方】小儿惊啼——蝉蜕后半截为末，入薄荷脑少许，每服一匙蜜调下，亦治夜啼。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163053-03m2c1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163053-03m2c1l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"瘾疹——皮肤起红瘢痒，蝉蜕与薄荷叶等分为末，每酒服一钱，日三。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163058-qnoyvme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163058-qnoyvme"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"痘后目翳——蝉蜕为末，每服一钱，日二。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163100-gs815ty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163100-gs815ty"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小儿阴肿——蝉蜕半两煎水洗，内服五苓散，即肿消痛止。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163102-79b71d8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163102-79b71d8","updated":"20240122163106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蜣螂"}]},{"ID":"20240122163102-way9d9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163102-way9d9l","updated":"20240122163111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，寒，有毒。治小儿惊痫，瘛瘲，腹胀，寒热，大人癫疾，狂易。生池泽。一名蛣蜣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163114-4teeq0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163114-4teeq0t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产山区树间。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163116-fyf5o8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163116-fyf5o8p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸，性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163117-rvjb1en","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163117-rvjb1en"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】功能通二便，治食痫，癫疾狂阳，脱肛，灸疮出血。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163120-kiyrn6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163120-kiyrn6v"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【时珍】治大小便不通，下利赤白，脱肛，一切痔瘘疔肿，附骨疽疮，灸疮出血不止，鼻中息肉，小儿重舌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163124-y2sa3bl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163124-y2sa3bl","updated":"20240122163125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蝼蛄"}]},{"ID":"20240122163125-aeu90wx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163125-aeu90wx","updated":"20240122163137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，寒，无毒。治产难，出肉中剌，溃痈肿，下哽噎，解毒，除恶疮，生平泽。一名蟪蛄，一名天蝼。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163139-efcw7nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163139-efcw7nt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，穴地粪壤中而生，夜则外出求食，有短翅，能低飞。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163141-ydnheeh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163141-ydnheeh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸，性寒，无毒（或作有毒）。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163142-o1ai53k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163142-o1ai53k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蝼蛄主行水解毒，下哽噎，利二便，治大腹水肿，通石淋，疗难产，外涂出肉剌，治痈肿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163144-xbxfdsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163144-xbxfdsm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】治水肿，头面肿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163146-3lfzto4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163146-3lfzto4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【丹溪】治口疮甚效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163147-etimtbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163147-etimtbn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163148-ypd9n7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163148-ypd9n7p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】欲利大小便，用自腰以后半截，但其性急，虚者忌之，入药取雄者（善鸣而非腹较小），去翅足炒用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163137-vwt9vpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163137-vwt9vpu","updated":"20240122163156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"马陆"}]},{"ID":"20240122163159-h3rv6d2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163159-h3rv6d2","updated":"20240122163206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，有毒。治腹中大坚症，破积聚，息肉，恶疮，白秃。生川谷。一名百足。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163206-mitj9xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163206-mitj9xw","updated":"20240122163210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"地胆"}]},{"ID":"20240122163211-qbe778g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163211-qbe778g","updated":"20240122163216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，寒，有毒。治鬼疰，寒热，鼠瘰，恶疮，死肌，破症瘕，堕胎。生川谷。一名蚖青。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163216-tsuu5yl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163216-tsuu5yl","updated":"20240122163219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鼠妇"}]},{"ID":"20240122163219-dggspvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163219-dggspvh","updated":"20240122163223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味酸，温，无毒。治气癃不得小便，妇人月闭，血症，痫，痉，寒热，利水道。生平谷及人家地上。一名负燔，一名蝛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163224-tey0qq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163224-tey0qq9"}},{"ID":"20240122163229-yesgmb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163229-yesgmb6"}},{"ID":"20240122163229-5e73xes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163229-5e73xes","updated":"20240204151437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个343，344，345蜣螂，346，蝼蛄，347马陆、地胆、鼠妇，这些药我们临床上使用的时候很少，几乎都没有人使用它，诸位可以看，雀瓮，344这个还用的比较多，雀瓮就是我们常常解释的蝉蜕，我们前面本草经，我常常之前就跟大家讲过的，有些药它会重复的原因是什么，因为地方的方言说出的不一样，不一样就误解视为两种药，实际上是一种，因为地方方言的关系，那这个雀瓮就是蝉蜕，知了，夏天的时候在叫，味甘，咸寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240122163235-nbmxk5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163235-nbmxk5o","updated":"20240204151630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"任何的蝉蜕，你看像蛇蜕，蜕皮的东西呢，甲壳类蜕皮的东西，都能够退眼睛的翳，所以治疗眼科的时候我们都会使用它。诸位看，如果说我们用秦皮，然后呢蝉蜕，就你们现在得到的知识我们来看蛇蜕这几位药，那如果说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"秦皮我们用三钱，蝉蜕五分，然后一剂三碗水煮一碗，不多啊，然后过滤掉，用这来点眼药水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，很好啊，内服都可以，中医中药就有这样的好处，外面去点眼药水，有秦皮在里面，可以止痛止痒眼睛的红肿刺痛，消炎，像那个结膜炎，角膜炎，那去眼翳的障碍，生白内障眼翳的东西，内服也可以，你看这个蝉蜕，跟这个蛇蜕呢，在206页最下方最后面，它的意思是除了眼翳以外还有小孩子哑病，阴囊肿起来都可以使用这个蝉蜕。当然蛇蜕也可以使用，我们今天介绍到这里。"}]}]}